{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Unfortunately, Dice & Cube is undergoing maintenance at this time.": "",
  "Please come back again.": "",
  "Please choose your course and ruleset.": "",
  "The Long Course with the Challenge rules. Understood.": "",
  "The Long Course with the Standard rules. Understood.": "",
  "The Middle Course with the Challenge rules. Understood.": "",
  "The Middle Course with the Standard rules. Understood.": "",
  "The Short Course with the Challenge rules. Understood.": "",
  "The Short Course with the Standard rules. Understood.": "",
  "Your Free Pass has been verified! Please equip your VR goggles at this time.": "",
  "Thank you for using your Play Pass! Please equip your VR goggles at this time.": "",
  "I don't have enough...": "",
  "I'm afraid you'll need Play Passes in order to enjoy Dice & Cube. You can get them as prizes from the batting cages.": "",
  "(Damn. Couldn't do it...)": "",
  "Bad luck this time, huh?": "",
  "(Too bad. Guess I should report back to that homeless guy.)": "",
  "(That actually turned out pretty good, I'd say.)": "",
  "Oh wow! You breezed right through that course!": "",
  "Here's your Luxury Meal Ticket for winning. Congratulations!": "",
  "(Great, now to give this to the homeless guy and figure out where Red Nose is.)": "",
  "(Damn... I thought I had it there.)": "",
  "(Just barely made it to the goal.)": "",
  "(Could've been better.)": "",
  "(Nice. That was a good run.)": "",
  "(Sweet! I pretty much nailed it!)": "",
  "Thank you for playing Dice & Cube. We hope to see you again.": "",
  "Here you can play the latest in virtual reality entertainment: the one and only Dice & Cube!": "",
  "You're coming with me, you piece of shit!": "",
  "There are some unscrupulous-looking men creating a commotion in our store. Won't you do something about it?": "",
  "They're disturbing the other guests... Please, will you help us out?": "",
  "There's this guy who's been causing a lot of problems lately... Can you do something about it?": "",
  "Some random guy came in without permission. Can you kick him out?": "",
  "One of our guests is just sitting around and not ordering anything. Would you be able to get him to leave?": "",
  "Someone's causing a scene at the drone lab. Is there any way for you to calm him down?": "",
  "Would you mind getting rid of this for me? I'll give you something nice if you do!　": "",
  "This drone's flying around like it's got a mind of it's own! It's at the drone race reception desk, so please hurry!": "",
  "I see. In that case, I'm pleased to make your acquaintance!": "",
  "I'm your receptionist today, Naisu Daisu.": "",
  "(As in... nice dice? I'm so sorry.)": "",
  "We hope you have an amazing experience that brings you back for more!": "",
  "Please! Come quick! My store's about to get ruined...": "",
  "Welcome? Where are we going, you ask?\nWell, hop in and you'll find out.": "",
  "...It seems you have collected 6 Free Pass Vouchers.": "",
  "Congratulations! Please accept this special gift.": "",
  "This is a Free Pass that allows you to play an unlimited amount Dice & Cube any time you wish.": "",
  "From now on, you won't need to use any more Play Passes!": "",
  "I'm afraid you don't have enough Play Passes.": "",
  "Please select an eligible course.": "",
  "Thank you for playing Dice & Cube!": "",
  "...Oh! I apologize for the sudden appearance.": "",
  "I'm Shinano, I lead the Dice & Cube section of the Kamurocho committee. ": "",
  "...Are you aware of Free Passes?": "",
  "No, what's that?": "",
  "A Free Pass allows you to play Dice & Cube as many times as you want. No more Play Passes needed.": "",
  "Basically it's the only pass you'll ever need again!": "",
  "Huh, I didn't know there was such a thing. How do I get it?": "",
  "You have to collect 6 Free Pass Vouchers...": "",
  "But the locations where you can find them are a secret! Please go try looking for them.": "",
  "I see... I'll keep that in mind.": "",
  "Great! Then have a happy virtual life!": "",
  "There's a railgun that you can use in virtual reality! You can rapid fire if you hold down <symbol=button_sankaku>. Try it, it's fun!": "",
  "King Koro-nyan will spawn somewhere on the map if you beat a golden enemy, so go for the gold as much as you can!": "",
  "You have to defeat the purple enemies! If you don't, a Kuro-nyan will appear to take your loot!": "",
  "Ahh... Koro-nyan... Such a cute little dice boy...": "",
  "You can get a Koro-nyan plushie from UFO Catchers!": "",
  "I'm thinking about making a song about Koro-nyan and releasing it worldwide!": "",
  "KamuroGo has a lot of missions, so try them out sometime!": "",
  "You can experience pretty much anything in VR... I mean, it's not like you can fight against tigers in real life!": "",
  "Koro-nyan is always saying \"sonny.\" Don't you think that makes him sound a bit old?": "",
  "It's better to clear the course with more dice at the end because you'll rack up more points!": "",
  "You can easily spot King Koro-nyan and Kuro-nyan on the map!": "",
  "When you win a Battle Mission, the dice you'll receive is equal to the number of stars on that space!": "",
  "You can see how many more spaces you have to go if you bring the cursor on the map. Useful, right?": "",
  "Koro-nyan has a Hiroshima dialect, but I speak more like a Tokyoite! ...Hm? You don't care?": "",
  "If Kuro-nyan takes your items, you can get twice as much back by capturing him!": "",
  "I think I'm going to play some Dice & Cube too... huh? I don't have enough Play Passes!?": "",
  "That euphoria when Koro-nyan Mode begins... it's indescribable.": "",
  "Wouldn't it be nice to play Dice & Cube in other cities besides Kamurocho? Not like we have that kind of budget...": "",
  "Losing a battle means you get sent back to the start, so be careful while you're in there.": "",
  "Ever notice how the dice changes to Koro-nyan whenever you're in Koro-nyan Mode?": "",
  "You've played this before, right? Have fun!": "",
  "We're giving out free play passes to customers who do a trial run.": "",
  "Give it a shot sometime!": "",
  "And, here's your free play pass for trying it out.": "",
  "Hope to see you back soon!": "",
  "(It's empty? I should ask the front desk to fix that.)": "",
  "(It's 500 yen for three tries, but I'm too poor... This is a new low.)": "",
  "Welcome to Club SEGA, sir! Can I help you with anything today?": "",
  "Think you could change out the prizes in the UFO catchers?": "",
  "Of course, sir! Just a moment.": "",
  "All done! Thanks for your patience.": "",
  "I'm good, actually.": "",
  "Okay! Let us know if you need any help.": "",
  "Yo, Tak. Looking for work? Here's what I've got.": "",
  "You've got this, Tak!": "",
  "Whew... Finally got it...": "",
  "*huff* *huff* Sorry... It's a really fast hat.": "",
  "That was pretty crazy, man. Here.": "",
  "Uh... Aren't you going to wear it?": "",
  "Nah. I can't put it on when anyone's watching.": "",
  "Which brings me to my next point. Do I look... familiar to you?": "",
  "Now that you mention it, I do feel like I recognize you...": "",
  "*sigh* I guess you'll find out when you turn on your TV...": "",
  "You mind letting me explain real quick?": "",
  "...N-No one's looking, right?": "",
  "Not that I can tell.": "",
  "All right. Here goes.": "",
  "Tch. That wind was rather mischievous, eh? I feel downright teased.": "",
  "Perhaps my old friend, the wind, got jealous of how much sunlight I've been taking in lately! What a cad.": "",
  "(Why is he suddenly acting like a different person...)": "",
  "Oh, what a heel I've been. I should introduce myself! I'm Toya Tokunaga... the idol.": "",
  "Huh!? You're an idol?": "",
  "Oh, you don't know me? Here I was thinking I was famous.": "",
  "If rumors are to be believed, Toya Tokunaga is the fire behind a certain subset of every woman's desire!": "",
  "O-Oh. So I see.": "",
  "So, who might you be? You've got a mean sprint.": "",
  "I'm Yagami. I run a private eye business in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Well I do apologize for taking you into such a place as this, Yagami-san.": "",
  "My face is such a well-known commodity, I can't let people see me like this.": "",
  "I guess that's understandable.": "",
  "But I do have a favor to ask. Can you keep the hat a secret?": "",
  "Toya Tokunaga is a singing and dancing idol with silky smooth hair that flits about in the breeze.": "",
  "If people were to find out my silky locks were just a hat...": "",
  "It's fine. Your secret is safe with me.": "",
  "Thanks for your cooperation, man.": "",
  "This is a token of my gratitude. Not hush money or anything.": "",
  "Anyway, I'm due for a taping right now. We shall meet again... through the magic of TV!": "",
  "(He came in like a gale and left like a breeze...)": "",
  "...What is that? Some weird bird...? No...": "",
  "What is this...?": "",
  "That's mine!": "",
  "Waaaiiit!": "",
  "Ouch!": "",
  "Ugh. Grgh! Shit! Not now!": "",
  "Hey... You okay, man?": "",
  "Ugh. I think I sprained my ankle...": "",
  "But more importantly, my hat!": "",
  "...Hat?": "",
  "(That was most certainly a wig.)": "",
  "I'm sorry, but you have to go after it! Please!": "",
  "It's an emergency! I don't know what I'd do without it!": "",
  "I'll pay you! C'mon! Help a brother out!": "",
  "Ugh, fine.": "",
  "Oh, Tomioka-san!": "",
  "(That's Rie Tomioka. She's the owner of Building One, where my office is.)": "",
  "(Three years ago, the first case I tackled after quitting my job as a lawyer and becoming a detective was for her.)": "",
  "(It was supposed to be as simple as finding her lost dog, but...)": "",
  "(I guess you could say it was bad luck that the dog ended up at the site of a drug trade. It was terrible...)": "",
  "(Ever since then, she's been letting me rent a room for cheap... which helps, since I never have money.)": "",
  "(But even paying cheap rent is tough...)": "",
  "Um, sorry to ask, but... would you mind waiting a little bit longer for this month's rent?": "",
  "Even if I said I no, you probably couldn't afford to pay me right now anyway. Am I right?": "",
  "Well, I'm glad you can at least afford to put food in your mouth. I worry sometimes, you know...": "",
  "...That would be a yes. Sorry...": "",
  "After all, if you starved to death in your office, the building would be designated as a stigmatized property.": "",
  "So that's what you were worried about...": "",
  "By the way, Yagami-kun. In exchange for waiting on your rent for the umpteenth time, I wanted to ask you a favor.": "",
  "Such as?": "",
  "Well, I've been thinking. I'd like to utilize all our available space in the building, so I've decided to open an izakaya.": "",
  "You know, since our <font_kind=yakuza_italic>rent income</font_kind> isn't all that stable.": "",
  "Well... You really got me with that one. What can I do to help?": "",
  "I wanted to get some feedback on the menu I've been making.": "",
  "I'm sure you have all sorts of useful advice, as someone who seems to know their way around the culinary world.": "",
  "That I can do.": "",
  "So, would you mind lending me a hand? Rather, your taste buds?": "",
  "Well, you've treated me good for so long, plus you're offering me free food? That's an offer I definitely can't refuse.": "",
  "Wonderful! Then it's settled!": "",
  "What I will do... is put some of the dishes I'm planning to serve inside your office fridge.": "",
  "Then, you can give me your thoughts once you try it.": "",
  "Got it. How exactly do you want my feedback, though?": "",
  "Just send me a message whenever you're free. How's that for simple?": "",
  "Perfect. Can I have your contact ID?": "",
  "Sure, just a moment...": "",
  "Okay, there we go! I'll be counting on you from now on.": "",
  "I won't let you down.": "",
  "(I better take a look at the office fridge every now and then to see what she cooks up.)": "",
  "(Oh, there's food in here. Is that... curry?)": "",
  "(There's a note attached to it. Let's see...)": "",
  "(\"To: Yagami-kun.\nI made you some curry.\")": "",
  "(\"But I thought regular curry would be too boring, so I added some bitter melon, one of my favorite fruits.\")": "",
  "(\"I thought that spiciness of curry and the bitterness of the melon would balance out well. Hope you enjoy.\")": "",
  "(\"Oh, and don't hold back when sending me your feedback, either. Your honesty only helps me improve. From: Tomioka.\")": "",
  "(Does bitter melon really go well with curry? I should heat it up and find out.)": "",
  "(Ngh... This is... god-awful.)": "",
  "(The curry's pungent spice only makes the bitter melon stand out... and not in a good way.)": "",
  "(And the vegetables aren't even fully cut! Serving this would probably violate some kind of health and safety law.)": "",
  "(Anyway, I should message Tomioka-san my feedback...)": "",
  "(I think this is good enough.)": "",
  "(But... will I always have to eat garbage like this from now on?)": "",
  "(I mean, it didn't seem like such a bad gig at first, but after forcing this down my gullet...)": "",
  "(Well, guess what's done is done. Hope the next one tastes at least a little better...)": "",
  "(Oh, there's food in here. This is... chicken karaage?)": "",
  "(There's a note attached to it again. Let's see...)": "",
  "(\"To: Yagami-kun.\nI tried out that curry myself.\")": "",
  "(\"And honestly, that was the worst curry I've had in my entire life...\")": "",
  "(\"Sorry for making you suffer through that. This time, it'll be ten times better!\")": "",
  "(\"So feast your eyes on my special chicken karaage! Who doesn't like that, right? And to spice it up a bit...\")": "",
  "(\"I put wasabi in the flour, just to add a little something.\")": "",
  "(\"I'm sure I got it right this time, so please let me know!\nFrom: Tomioka.\")": "",
  "(Wasabi in chicken karaage? ...I have a bad feeling about this.)": "",
  "(Guess I have to try it out anyway.)": "",
  "(...Ngh! This tastes like...)": "",
  "(...Actually, it tastes kinda good. The wasabi gives it a nice kick.)": "",
  "(As a matter of fact, its sharp flavor might set it apart from other chicken karaage... Mmph!?)": "",
  "*cough* Whoa!! *cough cough*": "",
  "(Bweh... Some pieces have <font_kind=yakuza_italic>way</font_kind> more wasabi than others...)": "",
  "(I doubt that any customer will consider this a pleasant surprise. It'd be more like their last.)": "",
  "(Anyway, I should probably paraphrase this to Tomioka-san...)": "",
  "(Okay, that should do the trick.)": "",
  "(Compared to before, Tomioka-san does seem to be improving, though.)": "",
  "(Maybe her next dish will be... fully edible?)": "",
  "(Strangely enough, I'm actually looking forward to it.)": "",
  "(Oh, there's food in here. This is... okonomiyaki?)": "",
  "(What's the note say...)": "",
  "(\"To: Yagami-kun.\nThanks for trying the karaage.\")": "",
  "(\"Like you said, the wasabi was spread out pretty unevenly.\")": "",
  "(\"I'll make sure to be more careful next time.\")": "",
  "(\"Anyway, for our next delicacy, I decided to whip up some okonomiyaki.\")": "",
  "(\"I had some during my trip to Sotenbori, and it tasted so good, I never forgot it!\")": "",
  "(\"So I did my homework and learned how to make a pretty mean okonomiyaki myself.\")": "",
  "(\"Taste it, and you'll swear it was the real deal!\nFrom: Tomioka\")": "",
  "(Okonomiyaki, huh? Time to give it a try...)": "",
  "(This... tastes...)": "",
  "(Delicious! The batter is light and fluffy, and the sauce with a hint of mustard tantalizes the tongue!)": "",
  "(I bet this would go perfect with a frosty mug of beer.)": "",
  "(I'm amazed. Tomioka-san really has improved!)": "",
  "(I'll let her know right away!)": "",
  "(I think this is good.)": "",
  "(I can't believe how far Tomioka-san has come in such a short amount of time.)": "",
  "(If the rest of her menu turns out this good, I'm sure her izakaya will be a big hit.)": "",
  "(Oh, Tomioka-san put some food in here. This is... meat and potato stew.)": "",
  "(Oh, Tomioka-san put some food in here. This is... omurice.)": "",
  "(Oh, Tomioka-san put some food in here. This is... beef stew.)": "",
  "(Oh, Tomioka-san put some food in here. This is... fried shrimp.)": "",
  "(Oh, Tomioka-san put some food in here. This is... hamburg steak.)": "",
  "(I'll warm it up and eat it right away.)": "",
  "(...Man, that's good!)": "",
  "(Nah, I'll save it for later...)": "",
  "♪ Far beyond the road of life, and deep within my dreams, I chase behind a shadow that my mind's eye cannot see ♪": "",
  "♪ The moments when I care the most, is when I get too close, but then the voice inside of me rings out with all my hope ♪": "",
  "That was \"Amidst a Dream\" by yours truly, Sana Mihama! Thank you all for listening!": "",
  "Woo! Go Sana-chaaaan!": "",
  "Amazing as always, Sana-chan!": "",
  "Yeah! It's like I could feel your thoughts emanating into the deepest parts of my soul...": "",
  "Nothing brightens up my day like a sweet serenade from Sana-chan!": "",
  "Ota-san, Kitamura-san, Tsunawatari-san... Thank you all so much!": "",
  "Oh yeah! I'll be purchasing your CD, too!": "",
  "Me too... Actually, I'll take two!": "",
  "Then I'll take three!": "",
  "You have no idea how much I appreciate this... Thank you, everyone!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Please come back again.": "แวะมาใหม่นะคะ",
  "Of course, sir! Just a moment.": "ได้เลยค่ะ! รอสักครู่นะคะ",
  "I'm good, actually.": "ไม่ล่ะ ไม่เป็นไร",
  "What is this...?": "นี่มันอะไรกัน...?",
  "Ouch!": "โอ๊ย!",
  "Such as?": "เช่น?"
 }
}
